      "sourceTextSha256": "3f85caf5fb6c6d8c9886ee1347fea6507938cd94fded28d25dbcef460e98c56d",
      "text": "This journey brings together 3 very different parts of Chile. Begin in Santiago, with its historic centre, modern neighbourhoods and restaurants serving creative cuisine. Then travel to the Atacama for Moon Valley, high-altitude lagoons, flamingos, the Tatio geysers and a star-filled sky away from city lights. The final days take you to Patagonia, among granite peaks, turquoise lakes, icebergs and Grey Glacier.",
